					Five honest reasons: (1) you're an individual or family, not a team or SaaS;
					(2) you value one-command-install over anything customisable;
					(3) you actively use the bundled CalDAV/CardDAV (Nextcloud-based);
					(4) you want the CC0 public-domain license, not AGPL-3.0;
					(5) you specifically don't want to learn Docker or YAML config. Mail-in-a-Box
